Fixed a bug in klogind (I had written read instead of write).

This is my re-implementation of encryption in Bones (kerberos without
encryption).
I believe my routes are compatable with MIT's (please send me email
if they are not).

There my still be some word alligment problems on some machines,
please contact me if you find any.

